# CKD Prediction Web App

A Machine Learning-based web application that predicts the possibility of Chronic Kidney Disease (CKD) using clinical patient parameters.

## Features

- User registration and login
- Patient data entry
- CKD prediction using a trained Machine Learning model
- Patient record management
- Prediction results
- PDF report generation
- SQLite database
- Flask web application

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Flask
- Flask-SQLAlchemy
- Flask-Migrate
- Flask-Mail
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Joblib
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- SQLite

## Machine Learning

The trained model uses clinical parameters such as:

- Age
- Blood Pressure
- Specific Gravity
- Albumin
- Sugar
- Blood Glucose
- Blood Urea
- Serum Creatinine
- Hemoglobin
- Hypertension
- Diabetes Mellitus
- Anemia

The trained model is stored in `model.pkl`.

